            <title>[MAHOUT-528] Perverse serialization format ... JSON contain strings that parse into JSON that contain strings that parse into JSON</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-528</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The current use of gson has some very odd use of strings that could be eliminated to allow much faster serialization with less memory use.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Backwards compatibility should be a mild goal with this fix.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
